  "source_assessment": [
    "Collector creates new tuple snapshots under a threading lock; acknowledged UUIDs are nonempty strings; snapshots retain original input indexes.",
    "Timeout cleanup waits on submitted coroutine outermost finally rather than concurrent Future.cancelled/done. Unconfirmed cleanup stops before later batches, runtime reads or publication.",
    "Known failure reasons and never-started inputs remain separate from started-without-acknowledgement.",
    "Initial fan-out and existing bounded serial429replay share collection; no automatic full-batch retry was added.",
    "Already-completed inner TimeoutError and failed cancel race preserve actual Future outcome.",
    "Configured finite cancellation grace is bounded0..30s; invalid/non-finite values default2s.",
    "Cast-filter denominators, exact source/reference-time forwarding, UUID input order and actor-seed acceptance remain covered; private/direct serial behavior remains as before."
  ],
